{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cf75ec1f-d0c4-8bee-9813-c1fd3b469506",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T13:27:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Edson Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hello. Um, I found a cat. A lost cat, I think. It has a collar on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Alright, you found a cat with a collar. Is the cat with you right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is in my... [pause] in my kitchen. It came to the back door this morning. Very friendly. And so I let it in, because it is cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That was kind of you. Does the collar have a tag, a name or a number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me see. Hold on, please. I must look for my glasses. [pause] They are on the, the table by the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, sir. I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] ... no, not that one. [pause] Okay. I have them. Sorry. What was it you asked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whether the collar has a tag on it, with a name or a phone number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yes. There is a little tag, but it is just a blue one. It is a rabies tag, I think. Numbers only. No name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That can actually help, because the number can be traced back to a vet. Now, what I'd suggest is you contact animal control so they can log the cat as found."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is what I wanted to ask. Who, um... who is it that responds? For this. Is it the police? Or somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In Newport the animal control officer handles found animals. I can take your information and pass it along, and they'll call you back. Could I have your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Edson Semedo. S-E-M-E-D-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Semedo. And a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0194. And I'll note you have the cat inside, blue rabies tag, no name. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. It is a gray cat. Gray, with a little white on the, the paws. I forgot to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:27:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, I'll add that. Someone should call you back. If you don't hear by this evening, it may be the holiday, so give it a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. Thank you very much. Happy holidays to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T13:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Semedo. Take care of that cat."
    }
  ],
